  "details": "I would like to see the existing Avatar Menu to be migrated over to the Debug Menu. I believe the new framework would allow for better readability, easier debugging, and improved filtering of the display. \n\nI believe this will solve:\n\n- Consistent location for debugging (one panel vs two)\n\n- Refresh the UI to not be a terminal experience\n\n- Improve user readability\n\n- Improve the VR and Desktop experience \n\n- Improve Branding consistency by adopting new debug theming/design\n\nI would like to see: \n\n- Filtering/Searching of different data types depending on the context. (Int,Bool,Tracking/Not Tracking, ETC)\n\n- Pinning of value so it can present on one panel all together. This would be the equivalent of a watch menu inside an IDE. \n\nI've attached an example of what I roughly conceptualize for this type of menu.",
